#. Description of the plugin
#: sm-weight-engine.php
msgid "Steel section catalogue (IPE, HEA, HEB, HEM, IPN, UPN, UPE, angles, tubes, flats, bars, plates) with sourced and cross-checked reference data, exact cross-section drawings and theoretical weight calculations (bars <-> total weight). Requires SM Core."
